    "text": "<p>Chron.com, the online version of the Houston Chronicle, is widely regarded as one of the top newspaper websites in the country. Recently, Chron.com published an article advocating for patients to receive proper oral care using high-quality products during hospitalization. It’s an important issue that needs to be addressed. To read the full article, <a title=\"Read the Houston Chronicle oral care article.\" href=\"https://www.chron.com/sponsoredarticles/lifestyle/senior-living/article/Can-brushing-your-teeth-keep-you-healthy-in-the-17345068.php\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a>.</p>\n<p>Our oral care products can help you reduce the risk factors that can lead to hospital-acquired infection. To learn more, <a title=\"Learn more about how Stryker's Sage oral care products can help you reduce the risk factors that can lead to hospital-acquired infection.\" href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/oral-hygiene.html\">click here</a>.</p>\n",
